{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_0116EUjWrhTSFNTFywu8EfGZ","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"All 46 tests pass, including all 22 new tests covering R1.5, R2.1, R2.2, R2.3, and combinations. Every new test case matches `grealpath` byte-for-byte on stdout and exit code.\n\n**Summary of changes:**\n\n**`cmd/realpath/main.go`** — Added `config` struct with `strip`, `relativeTo`, `relativeBase` fields. Extended `parseArgs` to handle `-s`/`--strip`/`--no-symlinks`, `--relative-to=DIR`, and `--relative-base=DIR` (both `=` and space-separated forms). Added `resolveStrip` for `-s` mode (cleans path without EvalSymlinks, with optional `-e` existence check). Added `applyRelative`/`hasPathPrefix` for R2.1-R2.3 relative path output. DIR values are resolved using the same mode as operands.\n\n**`cmd/realpath/realpath_test.go`** — Added 22 differential test cases: `-s` with symlinks, existing files, dotdot, missing paths; `-s` combined with `-e` and `-m`; long forms `--strip`/`--no-symlinks`; `--relative-to` (with `=` and space forms); `--relative-base` (under, outside, exact match); combined `--relative-to` + `--relative-base`; and `-s` + `--relative-to`."}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1786,"cache_read_input_tokens":56031,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1786},"output_tokens":2,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"ee281473-7df6-40c9-835f-ac74196a76ca","uuid":"7d35d819-68fe-48c4-acef-9ed1e39b9ba5"}
